DotCode immutable symbol facts and independent vectors

The 113-entry 5-of-9 symbol character map and the fold, corner and control
facts are derived from backend/dotcode.c at Zint commit
4896136bdbebb1a0908a5cc419513efa5bf4bf70 (Zint 2.15.0). The test-only named
example grids are retained from backend/tests/test_dotcode.c at that revision.
https://github.com/zint/zint/tree/4896136bdbebb1a0908a5cc419513efa5bf4bf70/backend

Barry implements localization, decoding and correction independently. No
Zint encoder algorithm, external reader, executable or library is a runtime
dependency. The named fixtures and retained facts are not a redistribution
of the AIM specification or a claim of standards certification.

